description = "A libretro port of EDuke32, an advanced open-source source port of the Build engine used by Duke Nukem 3D. EDuke32 provides enhanced compatibility with Duke Nukem 3D, its expansions and numerous community-created modifications. Features include high-resolution graphics, improved rendering, widescreen support, advanced scripting through CON, custom maps, enhanced audio, modern input handling and hardware-accelerated OpenGL rendering. BUILD engine technology originally created by Ken Silverman, non-GPL rendering and engine technology used in EDuke32 available under BUILDLIC."
